rooms_desc ({"The enterance to the house of Solomanus.","This is the kitchen, with all the boring stuff that used to be in akitchen and that i don't detail.","This is the hall room in the house of Solomanus. Here he accepts his guests and usually chats with friends take place here.","The dining room of the house! Here Solomanus used to invite only thebest friends (maybe because only they forgive the meals they have to eathere).","This is a sideroom in the house of Solomanus, used to store thingsso they are not under feet but near to the exit.","This is the working room of Solomanus. You can see a large mahagony deskwith a lot of books, papers, magic-looking items on it.There are also books on the shelves, that cover each wall. Seems theowner travelled through the world and collected knowledge from everywhere.Files with maps, memories on monsters, quests etc. stand in perfect orderin a fileing cabinet.","The room is dominated by a cupboard with a lot of clothes inside and by ahuge mirror-table with all of the stuff a lady needs to take care of her beauty.","Bedroom in the house of *suppressed*. A huge french bed is located at thenorth wall, for obvios purpose. There's a cradle next to the bed. Seemsthe owner of this house doesn't lack luck :).","This is the bathroom of the Solomanus-house with all that equipment i don't wantto detail","Secret room.",})
rooms_short ({"Enterance","Kitchen","Hall room","Dining room","Sideroom","Solomanus's working room","Budoire","Bedroom","Bathroom","Secret room",})
